 approximated their fair values as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025 due to their short-term nature. The carrying values of the Perceptive Facility (as defined below) approximated its fair value as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025 due to its variable interest rate. The carrying value of the Company&#8217;s notes receivable approximated its fair value as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025 due to its variable interest rate. </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">11</p></div></div>
