customer deposits, milestone revenue, and clinical training. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Geographical information</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Revenues generated to customers outside of the United States were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_us-gaap_NonUsMember_hFzXGnK_EkC3H6yIUwI7Uw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_yJlZ9zjVdU-Wxbax0pxB9A">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_us-gaap_NonUsMember_WwkjXFugZEKxbLdgKgJJbQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_6M8_FRvE4kmYWhdaNQzXJg">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million for the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_us-gaap_NonUsMember_CAtur_-h0UG98no2Umy3tA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_IH0Mhkt0zU-n7oL4fBobmg">1.2</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_us-gaap_NonUsMember_f__mydQar0uMziMAdIul1g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr__9vpgDWbOU6TvhPaXNdPsQ">0.9</ix:nonFraction> million for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-