style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_OLdAZQF0f0-1NJLulxlneg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_r5DKxUyFk0ubAWc26dBLhg_7_3">61,519</ix:nonFraction></span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.27%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.44%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.36%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_FY6ZAtOH2UObH0ihkkk-OQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_Hmop0J8Fj02L15AG-CGqMw_7_6">65,807</ix:nonFraction></span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:0.23%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">For the three months ended June&#160;30,&#160;2026, the Company recognized interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_2Znuu00P8UyS9hLoxwyGpg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_T_cf3IJQv0ixPikelm5lig">2.1</ix:nonFraction> million, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_2Znuu00P8UyS9hLoxwyGpg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_uUXKcZWWnUirGhxHeJZVMQ">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million was cash and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_2Znuu00P8UyS9hLoxwyGpg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_9Ww0PlSEm0qAKzsOeE0lrA">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million was non-cash interest expense related to the amortization of deferred debt issuance costs and accrual of final payment fees. For the three months ended June&#160;30,&#160;2025, the Company recognized interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_CXeMpMWZWE-nV-SD8OWUtw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_IpwpabU1J0aREIQS3hbXKw">2.0</ix:nonFraction> million, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_CXeMpMWZWE-nV-SD8OWUtw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_SSoWJfl5UEKbZhctC0yJ0w">1.8</ix:nonFraction> million was cash and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_CXeMpMWZWE-nV-SD8OWUtw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_Qq2XV7ZXn0K5Ed3slEiAzw">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million was non-cash interest expense related to the amortization of deferred debt issuance costs and accrual of final payment fees. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">For the six months ended June&#160;30,&#160;2026, the Company recognized interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_uQD06iRDa0GewEF4g2olqg">4.4</ix:nonFraction> million, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_EIKdAGCEV0avb6yYRxju-w">3.9</ix:nonFraction> million was cash and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_635ZIjdXf0ifk25qQ19fbg">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million was non-cash interest expense related to the amortization of deferred debt issuance costs and accrual of final payment fees. For the six months ended June 30,&#160;2025, the Company recognized interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_NrFZM9V-EU2Sxr_n17urxw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_sJQp58nPo0yD6FKlrcrCLQ">3.9</ix:nonFraction> million, of which $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_NrFZM9V-EU2Sxr_n17urxw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_n-eka6pBU0qM8cojkHAg5Q">3.5</ix:nonFraction> million was cash and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_NrFZM9V-EU2Sxr_n17urxw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr__35Lwj7M50i7pShRfR9bQA">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million was non-cash interest expense related to the amortization of deferred debt issuance costs and accrual of final payment fees.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Perceptive Credit Facility</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">On July 25, 2024, the Company entered into a Credit Agreement and Guaranty with Perceptive Credit Holding IV, LP (&#8220;Perceptive&#8221;) as collateral agent and other lenders defined in the agreement (the &#8220;Perceptive Facility&#8221;) which was used to partially repay the Company&#8217;s previous </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_stim_SolarInvestmentCorpMember__WM9hbBTKk2meyCHVy_RXg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_mFtEcRUbsE2Xz8Py7X05RA">60.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> million credit facility with SLR Investment Corp. (formerly known as Solar Capital Ltd.)</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">. </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">17</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><a style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';" href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">NEURONETICS,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Interim Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_EfJswRnG9EKKJ35nPlVccg_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_EfJswRnG9EKKJ35nPlVccg_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;">The Perceptive Facility permits the Company to borrow up to an aggregate amount of </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_NOMcXV2OH0-rmmKtlS6Xow" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_6Sge2-Y9WEOvWlvxobbbOQ">90.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million in </span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_tranche_Ie81GNNL6EO8l37kjUbR6A" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_roQLizF50USf4py4ZieaNA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="stim:TermLoansNumberOfTranches" scale="0" id="Narr_cz5S_zQ3PkWeNJ6Q0-YVVA">three</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> tranches of term loans, a &#8220;Tranche 1 Loan&#8221;, a &#8220;Tranche 2 Loan&#8221; and a &#8220;Tranche 3 Loan.&#8221; On July 25, 2024, the Company borrowed an aggregate amount of </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheOneMember_T0O5OqLKOEyXb0ZymskL9w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_M2dZARH_p0C9f33BUfA-9w">50.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million, which was the aggregate amount available under the Tranche 1 Loan. Under the Tranche 2 Loan, the Company was permitted to borrow, at its election, up to an aggregate amount of </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheTwoMember_mue0xbK1_keiRDycf5OS8w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_FGz5r9X4akOFdVB1WnBiSA">15.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million (i) upon the Company achieving a specified amount of trailing twelve months net revenue, and (ii) assuming there had been no event of default under the Perceptive Facility prior to such election. The Tranche 2 Loan was available until January 31, 2026. Under the Tranche 3 Loan, the Company was permitted to borrow, at the consent of the Majority Lenders (as defined in the Perceptive Facility), up to an aggregate amount of </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_gad0jHs6Ck2utnN3sedrKA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_cY6o0RJN-kebeaRNeOyrKg">25.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million. The Tranche 3 Loan was available until June 30, 2026. There are no scheduled repayments of the principal on the Tranche 1 Loan, the Tranche 2 Loan or the Tranche 3 Loan prior to the maturity date. All amounts borrowed under the Perceptive Facility are due on July 25, 2029.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">Each of the Tranche 1 Loan, the Tranche 2 Loan and the Tranche 3 Loan accrues interest from the date of borrowing through the date of repayment at a floating per annum rate of interest equal to the sum of </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_roQLizF50USf4py4ZieaNA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_I97ffFEEiU2wVYjBab6TzA">7.00</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> plus the greater of (a) </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_roQLizF50USf4py4ZieaNA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:DebtInstrumentThresholdRateConsideredForCalculatingFloatingInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZEUG52ppbUW8giCKTS-vlQ">4.50</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> and (b) One-Month Term SOFR (as defined in the Perceptive Facility). </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">If the Company prepays Tranche 1 Loan, the Tranche 2 Loan, or the Tranche 3 Loan prior to the maturity date, the Company will also be required to pay prepayment fees to Perceptive equal to </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodOneMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_hOeYHW99Gk2P2VlBTzRNRA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:LineOfCreditFacilityPrepaymentFeesPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lxAhLP8wlE2FmGQJK76pzw">6</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> of the principal amount of such term loan then-prepaid if prepaid on or before the first anniversary of the closing date, </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodTwoMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_sbW-NKWyiEKE_PoeO7BTDQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:LineOfCreditFacilityPrepaymentFeesPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_laA9LgIRNkah4s0v6NJYZw">5</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> of the principal amount of such term loan then-prepaid if prepaid after the first anniversary and on or before the second anniversary of the closing date, </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodThreeMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_kHSnJDGNsEi7VDiVRtHDVg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:LineOfCreditFacilityPrepaymentFeesPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_s7nTBnv9kEerrpgzr_Rt4A">4</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> of the principal amount of such term loan then-prepaid if prepaid after the second anniversary and on or before the third anniversary of the closing date, and </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_bGSUQZxd9UKVq-79C8rH8g" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodFourMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_jJHVGKDeTku1y-v0oF9qdw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:LineOfCreditFacilityPrepaymentFeesPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_xtI2a09gR0-wvK7fLmIsBg">3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> of the principal amount of such term loan then-prepaid if prepaid after the third anniversary and on or before the fourth anniversary of the closing date.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">The Company&#8217;s obligations under the Perceptive Facility are secured by a first priority security interest in substantially all of the Company&#8217;s assets, including its intellectual property. The Perceptive Facility requires the Company to comply with a quarterly minimum trailing revenue covenant commencing March 2025 and a minimum liquidity covenant as well as affirmative and negative covenants.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">The Perceptive Facility contains events of default, including, without limitation, events of default upon: (i) failure to make payment pursuant to the terms of the agreement; (ii) violation of covenants; (iii) material adverse changes to the Company&#8217;s business; (iv) insolvency; (v) material cross-defaults; (vi) significant judgments, orders, or decrees for payments by the Company; (vii) incorrectness of representations and warranties; (viii) significant adverse events related to the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974; (ix) failure by the Company to be registered with the SEC in good standing; or (x) failure by the Company to maintain a valid and perfected lien on the collateral securing the borrowing.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As consideration for the Perceptive Facility, the Company agreed to issue to Perceptive warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_NOMcXV2OH0-rmmKtlS6Xow" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_GZQ8aCz-ukKxRgYFp1tyDg">1,462,500</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, with a warrant exercisable into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheOneMember_T0O5OqLKOEyXb0ZymskL9w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:WarrantsExercisable" scale="0" id="Narr_VqSzARq6y0u0STP1MVxVIw">1,125,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock issued on the closing date (the &#8220;Initial Warrant&#8221;). The per share exercise price for the Initial Warrant is equal to the lower of (x) the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_uQ51hgMIzEOA0q2q1EBm_A" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_roQLizF50USf4py4ZieaNA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDaysVolumeWeightedAveragePricePriorToClosingDate" scale="0" id="Narr_HNQ7YgX9Ek66ryNj8jc2ow">10</ix:nonFraction>-day volume weighted average price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the business day immediately prior to the closing date and (y) the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_uQ51hgMIzEOA0q2q1EBm_A" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_roQLizF50USf4py4ZieaNA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDaysVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOnSpecificDate" scale="0" id="Narr_DNLhzCWCFEKquTPbSDP4oA">10</ix:nonFraction>-day volume weighted average price of the common stock ended on August 31, 2024. In addition to the Initial Warrant, an additional warrant was issued for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2024_To_7_25_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheTwoMember_zfI36egqOUa5Qt_iLBRC7Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLinesOfCredit" scale="0" id="Narr_jLZ3ONkTIUq7Yn6aL_9XXA">225,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock concurrently with the borrowing of the Tranche 2 Loan. The per share exercise price for the additional warrant will be equal to the exercise price of the Initial Warrant. Each warrant will be exercisable, in whole or in part, until the tenth anniversary of the applicable date of issuance.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">Effective as of December 9, 2024, the Company amended the Perceptive Facility and borrowed against the Tranche 3 Loan in a principal amount of </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_12_9_2024_To_12_9_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_e9otE94BdUuv6jwjOlAKLA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_prlILcskZEKPOMSCy_tHwg">10.0</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> million and used the proceeds thereof to finance, in part, the operations of the combined enterprise after the acquisition of Greenbrook and the related transactions </span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">18</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><a style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';" href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">NEURONETICS,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Interim Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_EfJswRnG9EKKJ35nPlVccg_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">included in the Arrangement. As consideration for Tranche 3 Loan borrowing, the Company issued warrants to purchase </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_12_9_2024_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_p5qknzoqr0GaWe8W8hv4vg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_jRA_HDZSv0iMdNr0z6Nybg">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at a per share exercise price of </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ToRfxWbANkKRV5P1IX7z0w" contextRef="As_Of_12_9_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodFourMember_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_yQT1PXo7BU-in1u5vWXexA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_2Thl0xyZzEGAmojVotxKGQ">0.94</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">The Company calculated the issuance date fair value of the warrants using the Black-Scholes option pricing model, which resulted in a fair value of </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_cU8h5gX6CEW4IgqVvcDAHw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="6" id="Narr_lMSvJmrsYUWgQhqX1dA-qA">2.6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> million. Accordingly, the Company allocated the proceeds from the Perceptive Facility on a relative fair value basis resulting in </span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheThreeMember_FpGw_Amp70ag3oT0XIY40w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:ProceedsFromLinesOfCreditAllocatedToWarrants" scale="6" id="Narr_WHzwZPsCukSVDFZ_ylrn3A">2.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';"> million allocated to the warrants.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';">On March 26, 2025, the Company entered into Amendment No. 2 to Credit Agreement and Guaranty by and between the Company, as the borrower, and Perceptive, in its capacities as administrative agent for the lenders and the majority lender, in which the parties agreed to revise the net revenue covenant to align with the Company&#8217;s pre-existing operating plan for the first quarter of 2025.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On August 1, 2025, the Company entered into Amendment No. 3 to Credit Agreement and Guaranty (the &#8220;Perceptive Third Amendment&#8221;). Pursuant to the Perceptive Third Amendment, the Company borrowed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_8_1_2025_To_8_1_2025_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheTwoMember_bDO_vyD8qEuIGXiQ2TdC8Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_u16HjTd8h0SIOyqq6lZQJQ">10.0</ix:nonFraction> million under Tranche 2, lowered the minimum liquidity balance requirement to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_1_2025_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheTwoMember_wpdC792NDEWuA5kmnSut8A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:MinimumLiquidityBalance" scale="6" id="Narr_AyBQs7KfIUqN9Ee9-YIJnQ">2.0</ix:nonFraction> million through September 30, 2026, and issued Perceptive a warrant certificate exercisable into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_8_1_2025_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveFacilityTrancheTwoMember_wpdC792NDEWuA5kmnSut8A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_RWYPjAgjv0qf6_TFMtUmgA">225,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On January 15, 2026, the Company entered into Amendment No. 4 to Credit Agreement and Guaranty (the &#8220;Perceptive Fourth Amendment&#8221;). The Perceptive Fourth Amendment amended the Perceptive Facility to modify the requirements of subsidiaries joining as an obligor and subsidiary guarantor thereunder.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On March 12, 2026, the Company entered into Amendment No. 5 to the Credit Agreement and Guaranty (the &#8220;Perceptive Fifth Amendment&#8221;). Under the Perceptive Fifth Amendment, Neuronetics made a one-time principal payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_3_12_2026_To_3_12_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_TMxoHy-lNEKcKNXnXYXSzQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_L0OM2nNVUUOPRR5eZUB8xQ">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million, and Neuronetics and Perceptive agreed to adjustments to the existing debt covenants. In connection with the amendment, the Company incurred a prepayment penalty of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_3_12_2026_To_3_12_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_TMxoHy-lNEKcKNXnXYXSzQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:RepaymentOfPrepaymentPenalty" scale="6" id="Narr_whWhjj8m_0SZ-Cj9Pa1U0Q">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million, which, together with the proportional write-off of unamortized debt issuance costs and discounts, resulted in a total loss on partial debt extinguishment of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_3_12_2026_To_3_12_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_TMxoHy-lNEKcKNXnXYXSzQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_PMU0_d0enEmhWkBB_aCGJQ">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million for accounting purposes.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the Company had $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_stim_PerceptiveCreditHoldingsIvLpMember_BACf5_35UkmIkUA0jgrZWA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_rW-IRLwa20SflS2B0a6xow">65.0</ix:nonFraction> million of borrowings outstanding under the Perceptive Facility, which has a final maturity in July 2029. The interest rate on borrowings under the credit facility is variable and resets monthly. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Company was in compliance with the covenants under the Perceptive Facility as of June 30, 2026.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_OWnUtUJHw06qoVbSXfh6-A" continuedAt="Tb_OWnUtUJHw06qoVbSXfh6-A_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">15.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;COMMON STOCK</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Common Stock Offering</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On July 3, 2025, the Company entered into the Distribution Agreement, pursuant to which the Company may offer and sell shares of its common stock having an aggregate offering price of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_3_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_U0wuvN7z-02gUWXvyKhWLA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:CommonStockCapitalReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_Pg595xYDS0O7e1wo49RfkQ">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million from time to time through the ATM Program. Sales under the Distribution Agreement will be made pursuant to the Company&#8217;s Registration Statement on Form S-3 (File No. 333-288526) and a related prospectus and prospectus supplement.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company sold an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_5GB7F97vLUas1nOmGeefgw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_EexCViSVSEOXdyK6qn2VPA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_2FHzmuDXQEiCpKq5GfUMeQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_-xXMf5tNA06qn33MIggGBA">6,052,953</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock under the ATM Program at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ToRfxWbANkKRV5P1IX7z0w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_krW4a7ByMkmP4gjmYX0GkA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_jcUhkJbHMky3ANfFHO0VKA">1.31</ix:nonFraction> per share, generating gross proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_5GB7F97vLUas1nOmGeefgw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_vMUDFy3TYUKDAGNvog9JDQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_2FHzmuDXQEiCpKq5GfUMeQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_oWjzlnzuC0O21ymYZgcvWA">8.0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million. The Company paid aggregate sales commissions of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_5GB7F97vLUas1nOmGeefgw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:SalesCommissionOnStockIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_QsEqOkxKDE6bDKrYPbXypQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_2FHzmuDXQEiCpKq5GfUMeQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:SalesCommissionOnStockIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_oiNIBLcN00G4HLqsDWg51w">0.2</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million and incurred additional offering-related expenses of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:AdditionalOfferingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_J6vogHqEo0i505Haa9NGSA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_2Znuu00P8UyS9hLoxwyGpg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:AdditionalOfferingCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_h6fXcAerwEqrQf-UpcwYWg">0.2</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million. As a result, net proceeds from the offering are $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_5GB7F97vLUas1nOmGeefgw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStockNet" scale="6" id="Narr_y3QSDf0dcEuTDGWSfztItQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_2FHzmuDXQEiCpKq5GfUMeQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStockNet" scale="6" id="Narr_HHhVshFUr0GYkFEtgNmCpA">7.6</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million. The Company also amortized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_5GB7F97vLUas1nOmGeefgw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:AmortizationOfShelfRelatedOfferingExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_RO3HmYSp_kmVMGGvDL8uFQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_2FHzmuDXQEiCpKq5GfUMeQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:AmortizationOfShelfRelatedOfferingExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_koS5Nkt59kiG5x-Oa8TpcQ">0.1</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million of shelf related expenses for the ATM Program.There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_osG8dgfMAkCB08cHT5ccCw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="stim:AmortizationOfShelfRelatedOfferingExpenses" scale="0" id="Narr_gaFMRRUmf0mXMmKJMWEdhg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_ET81f9zpRUGF64jldIi0Pg" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="stim:AmortizationOfShelfRelatedOfferingExpenses" scale="0" id="Narr_i17_FnGX1kWvm54GF-FU6A">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> sales under the ATM Program for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">19</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><a style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';" href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">NEURONETICS,&#160;INC.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Interim Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_bd497be0_bce3_49c2_8bf7_5830598466f1"></a><a id="Tc_wcIdp7PJ6kmLk-DXdEISfg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Q8uqsjPXJ0KqVG0d1MxN5w_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_6Mg_IBzglUuuFRZxpVD-zw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_ubOpxPw8Nk2mTzAfB9lX3A_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_UASA1Pu9zkabUnQQTCdvlw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_lpzBc7q-WU-XwRCUs6ChTg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_Pix6xP-A706sFmtiXVOazQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_xOy6yrrQjE6jza0EWSIYlA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_irFdVC9u6UCeIeQ0lH7WHQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_FiXo0ihwp0usl_fzL0_tGw_9_0"></a><a id="_28683e94_81c6_4525_9ffc_91aac39a20ea"></a><a id="Tc_8xvEygGKD0mVYEhhr5KAGg_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_iwUEiv-k9kmVMjAx1YN0JQ_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_A65h5n2YEESnQydybwM0Dg_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_Zfc5LhWoTECi-RYw1C39gA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_xgYWq6UAK0uqywSYXLeDcw_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_MxTIdjbWTUinMrMTCeeOHg_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_Fls_LOpdVkm1nl3Ca_Gv8g_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_EXyB96d4oUGrviJeE3qs2Q_6_2"></a><a id="_84554166_1926_4a80_b3ca_345be89e1578"></a><a id="_84554166_1926_4a80_b3ca_345be89e1578_2"></a><a id="_84554166_1926_4a80_b3ca_345be89e1578_3"></a><a id="_84554166_1926_4a80_b3ca_345be89e1578_4"></a><a id="_84554166_1926_4a80_b3ca_345be89e1578_5"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_OWnUtUJHw06qoVbSXfh6-A_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the Company had approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bBHOybMHY0qDJ0mcCjRxyQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_stim_AtMarketEquityOfferingProgramMember_krW4a7ByMkmP4gjmYX0GkA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stim:CommonStockCapitalReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_ImfKQLTRW0i5wFBgg1XSPQ">33.7</ix:nonFraction> million remaining available for future issuance under the ATM Program.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Common Stock</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfStockByClassTextBlock" id="Tb_Aq8jMLzlPEaFlyL0BXQ3MQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">The following table summarizes the total number of shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock issued and reserved for issuance as of June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and December&#160;31,&#160;2025 (in thousands):</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:69.11%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap