="Tc_WtPo-3zUX0yRMYkHF0MJaQ_7_4"></a><a id="Tc_FkqbdNvhiEeBVfoOWGsN9w_7_7"></a><a id="Tc_oJzwshLtWEKFnZ7cBMozvw_7_9"></a><a id="Tc_lLCuuth1fkGjv4-USPOQAg_7_10"></a><a id="Tc_V1H1JexOvkCWxplUnSlI_A_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_0GIl9osmUkKFWsN-dCZCDQ_8_4"></a><a id="Tc_1BpoTbLO-0Kmqo3ARROA3w_8_9"></a><a id="Tc_k4daK4quPkKJ7IxgY76zBA_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_6MlKDqcfC0uObrA_Y1WZWw_9_4"></a><a id="Tc_zT5nbX6_CEW-RQAcoW_T_g_9_9"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb__zvirVF8AU6IM3Ydbi0XNw_cont1" continuedAt="Tb__zvirVF8AU6IM3Ydbi0XNw_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">2020 Inducement Incentive Plan</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;">In December 2020, the Board adopted the 2020 Inducement Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2020 Inducement Plan&#8221;), which authorized the issuance of up to </span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_stim_TwoThousandTwentyInducementIncentivePlanMember_4ux_HzZNC0O91yfWhkl37Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="6" id="Narr_QZfj60ZO00idey3l2_XcbQ">0.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million shares in the form of stock options, stock appreciation rights, restricted stock awards, restricted stock unit awards, performance stock awards and other stock awards to eligible employees who satisfy the standards for inducement grants under Nasdaq Global Market rules. In March 2022, the Board approved an additional </span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_stim_TwoThousandTwentyInducementIncentivePlanMember_b2Pn0pslCUqp_2_u0Gq92Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="6" id="Narr_pAf4h-p-JU2_yGGrrP3ZVw">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million shares for issuance under the 2020 Inducement Plan. In October 2025, the Board approved an additional </span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="Duration_10_1_2025_To_10_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_stim_TwoThousandTwentyInducementIncentivePlanMember_74Le7EgB102USnvuqb7Haw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="6" id="Narr_V8AjqeciGEy1tnZ82GCP7g">0.6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million shares for issuance under the plan. An individual who previously served as an employee or director of the Company is not eligible to receive awards under the 2020 Inducement Plan other than following a bona fide period of non-employment. The amount and terms of grants are determined by the Board. As of June&#160;30,&#160;2026, there were </span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_jC5RMZVEqUmikKwyPq4QHA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_stim_TwoThousandTwentyInducementIncentivePlanMember_97vCH4oatE60suclry1LTg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="6" id="Narr_r6VqQBuzBEqF600ArTUrSA">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> million shares available for future issuance under the 2020 Inducement Plan.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Stock Options</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026__wQNUBlkhUu7xmPgn_toEg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedCompensationStockOptionsActivityTableTextBlock" id="Tb_6XzsgxC1l0q8I4roIwJkUA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">The following table summarizes the Company&#8217;s stock option activity for the six months ended June&#160;30,&#160;2026:</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.65%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.83%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.36%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.83%;margin:0pt;padding: